i/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"礼服要是弄脏了的话，可就麻烦了…….得小心一点……。","text_original":"服に染みがついたら、大変、ですから……慎重に……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"呜……要不然，索性躲到那边的家具里面去…….。","text_original":"うぅ……いっそ、あそこの家具に、紛れて……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"穿礼服的时候，走路方式也必须……得注意……","text_original":"ドレスを着ているときは、歩き方も……気にしないと……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"(大家……穿着都很有个性呢。)","text_original":"（みなさん……個性的な格好を、されていますね）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"呜……想吃拉面……","text_original":"うぅ……ラーメンが食べたい、です……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"我……真的适合这套衣服吗……","text_original":"私は……この衣装に、相応しいのでしょうか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlobby_2_1","category":"event","text":"果然，太显眼了，对吧……?","text_original":"やっぱり、目立ってます、よね……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlobby_2_2","category":"event","text":"呜呜……我……明明是忍者……","text_original":"うぅ……私、忍者なのに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"漂，漂，漂亮吗……！？呜咿……","text_original":"き、き、ききキレイ、ですか……！？ひゃうううぅ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"如果把这身衣服，当作是变装之术，的话…….","text_original":"この服も、変装の術だと、思えば……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师……！？我穿这身礼物……果然，会，会很奇怪吗……?","text_original":"先生……！？このドレス……やっぱり、変、でしょうか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"欢迎回来，老师……那个,这身衣服是，这个……","text_original":"おかえりなさい、先生……。ええと、この格好は、その……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"到底……发生什么事了……?","text_original":"一体……何が起きてるんですか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_season_2_1","category":"event","text":"站在舞台上……有种不可思议的感觉。","text_original":"ステージの上は……不思議、です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_season_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_season_2_2","category":"event","text":"明明被许多人，注视着，但是…….会有这么一瞬间，感觉到一丝，孤独……","text_original":"たくさんの方に、見られてる、のに……孤独、だと思う瞬間が、あります……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_season_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"大家……！我……我回来了……!","text_original":"みなさん……！私……帰って、きました……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"那个…….我整理的东西……是有什么不对的吗……？","text_original":"えっと……私のまとめたものに……問題でも、ありましたか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"老师……?发生什么事了吗……?","text_original":"先生……？どうか、しましたか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"各位辛苦了……!是圆满的落幕，呢！","text_original":"お疲れ様、です……！素晴らしいフィナーレ、でした！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"不愧是……!老师的话一定能做到，我一直如此坚信……!","text_original":"さすが、です……！先生ならできるって、信じてました……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"好厉害……!难道老师也有作为忍者的才能……！？","text_original":"すごいです……！先生にも、忍者の才能が……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"我把要做的事情，都，汇总了一下……","text_original":"やることを、まとめて、みました……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"虽然每一件都不算容易，但是……老师的话，一定可以……!","text_original":"どれも簡単ではない、ですが……先生なら、きっと……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_eventmission_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"所谓忍者，即便被逼入绝境，也不会认输……!","text_original":"忍者は、窮地に立たされても、諦めないもの……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"这种时候，作为忍者，就要……!","text_original":"こういうとき、忍者、なら……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"就算把礼服弄破也必须……!","text_original":"ドレスが、破けたとしても……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"就由我，来阻止……!","text_original":"私が、止めます……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"请到我的身后来……!","text_original":"私の後ろに、下がってください……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"月咏流，新·替身之术，是也……!","text_original":"ツクヨ流、新・変わり身の術、です……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"我……接下来也会竭尽全力地努力的。为了和大家一起……成为了不起的忍者……!","text_original":"私……これからも精一杯、頑張り、ます。みなさんと、立派な忍者になる、ために……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"诶！要挖角……?我，我吗？","text_original":"えっ！スカウト……？私を、ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"我会……在注视下，走到最后的……!","text_original":"最後まで……歩ききって、みせます……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"嗯~……呀！？呜……","text_original":"う～ん……ひゃっ！？うぅぅ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是，大野月咏！虽然穿着礼服……但是我是货真价实忍者研究部的一员……!","text_original":"大野ツクヨ、です！ドレスを着てはいますが……正真正銘、忍術研究部の一員、です……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我好像，特别引人注目啊……。应该是我的错觉，吧……?","text_original":"私、すごく注目されてる、ような……。気のせい、ですよね……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"成长……?我真的，也是有才能的吗……？","text_original":"成長……？本当に、私にも才能が……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"这样的……对我来说，有点太过浪费了……","text_original":"こんなに……私には、もったいないです……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"属于我的舞台，现在才正要开始。请注视着，忍者月咏的新姿态吧……！","text_original":"私のステージは、これから、です。忍者ツクヨの新しい姿を、みて、ください……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"比起成为一名成熟的模特……我更想，成为能独当一面的忍者。","text_original":"一人前のモデル、よりも……一人前の忍者を、目指したい、です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这身礼服，您要不要，再凑近些看看……?","text_original":"この服、もう少し近くで、ご覧になりますか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"仔细看的话，做工非常精细呢……好神奇啊！","text_original":"よく見ると、作りがとても細かくて……不思議、なんです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"这，这是……我的写真，为什么会出现在夏莱……!","text_original":"こ、これは……私のグラビアが、どうしてシャーレに……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"用餐吗？我的话……除了沙拉，其他的都可以……","text_original":"食事、ですか？私は……サラダ以外、でしたら、なんでも……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"比起秀场的沙发……这里的办公椅，反而更能，安心。","text_original":"ファッションショーの会場にあったソファより……ここの事務椅子のほうが、落ち着き、ます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师您好……今天的我，是独属于老师一个人的模特……。","text_original":"こんにちは……。今日の私は、先生だけのモデル、です……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"让您久等了，老师。那个……这身礼服，如果让您吃了一惊的话，对，对不起……","text_original":"お待ちしてました、先生。えっと……ドレス姿、驚かせてしまったら、ごめん、なさい……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜……","text_original":"うぅっ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"勉强是越过围栏了，但是……","text_original":"なんとか、フェンスは越えられました、けど……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"衣服被钩住了……","text_original":"服が引っかかって……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"动不了了……","text_original":"動けない、です……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜呜……对不起……","text_original":"うぅ……ごめんなさい……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"都因为我，想抄近道……","text_original":"私が、近道をしようとしたから……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？老师，你是怎么到对面去的……","text_original":"……あれ？先生は、どうやって向こう側に……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"诶？围栏旁边有，小门……！？","text_original":"えっ？フェンスの横に、くぐり戸……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜呜……连这都不知道，我就……","text_original":"ううぅ……そうとも知らず、私は……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……老师……能不能，稍微帮我拉一下我的衣服？","text_original":"……先生……私の服、少し引っ張っていただいても、良いでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"晚礼服，很适合我吗……？真，真的吗？欸嘿嘿……","text_original":"ドレス、似合って、ますか……？本当、ですか？えへへ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"如果有老师一直注视着我……不管前方是什么样的，我都能……","text_original":"先生が、見守ってくれるなら……私は、どんな道でも……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"相比独自站在舞台上……我更希望在老师的身旁……","text_original":"ステージに、一人で立つより……先生のおそばに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"擅长的事，和，喜欢的事……非要选一个的话，我会选做喜欢的事情。","text_original":"得意、なことと、好き、なこと……どちらかを選ぶなら、私は……好きなこと、がいいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天是……我的生日吗?","text_original":"私の誕生日……ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"最近，太忙了……完全忘记了……非常感谢您还记得，老师！","text_original":"最近、忙しくて……すっかり、忘れてました……。ありがとうございます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐，老师。","text_original":"お誕生日、おめでとうございます、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为想给老师展示……所以我特意练习了……忍者步！可以，请您看看吗……?","text_original":"先生に、お見せしたくて……忍者ウォーキング、練習したんです……！見て、いただけますか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"就算是万圣节的变装……也有点，太过显眼了吧？","text_original":"ハロウィーンの仮装、にしても……派手すぎ、ますよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"诶……因为会有人穿得更夸张所以，没关系……?","text_original":"え……もっとすごい格好の人がいるから、大丈夫……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！新年的愿望……希望我喜欢的人们都能一直笑口常开。欸嘿嘿……","text_original":"あけまして、おめでとうございます！新年の、お願い……私の、好きな人たちが……笑っていてくれること、です。えへへ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师……！如果，可以的话……要不要一起……在圣诞的街道上走一走？","text_original":"先生……！もし、よろしければ……クリスマスの街を……一緒に、歩きませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"对于走路这件事，我是有自信，的……！","text_original":"ウォーキングには、自信がついてきたん、です……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"是因为我……自我管理不足……","text_original":"私の自己管理が、甘かった、から…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"对不起……下次，一定会……","text_original":"ごめんなさい…次は、必ず…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"请小心，脚下……!","text_original":"足元に、気をつけて、ください……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"模特……不对，忍者月咏……要上了！","text_original":"モデル……いえ、忍者、ツクヨ……行きます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"能顺利结束，太好了……!","text_original":"無事に終わって、よかった、です……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0297_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"大家，都没有受伤吧……?","text_original":"みなさん、お怪我は、ありませんか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A7%E9%87%8E%20%E6%9C%88%E5%92%8F/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0297_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0297_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝，档案。","text_original":